那两天都子回来的时候，都是做出Ｖ的手势，\n飞到我怀里来的。%K%P
I was sure Mr. Retired and the others were slowly noticing\nthe change in Toko's behavior, but they weren't saying\nanything, and instead continued treating us like they\nalways did.%K%P
老爷子他们也该从都子那么明显的态度\n里面看出什么了，但是他们这些人，\n不知为何态度一点都没变，一如既往地与我们相处。%K%P
I wonder if their antisocial way of life made them more\ntolerant to whatever Toko decided to get involved with, or\nif this development was too far even for them to make\njokes of.%K%P
果然就算是不良住户，也会对都子温柔，\n拿这种事情取乐，到底会让人难受…%K%P
