She would be irritated for sure, but I also had a feeling\nthat she would help me figure this whole thing out. After\nall, one would be hard pressed to find a woman more caring\nthan Asami.%K%P
…可能会吃惊，但估计还是会跟我一起考虑这件事。\n因为如果是麻实的话，任何事，她都不会视而不见的。　%K%P
