All I knew was that the sadness and frustration that took\nhold of me then far exceeded any of the physical pain.%K%P
只是，在全身奔驰着凌驾于疼痛与发热之上的后悔和伤心，\n无计可施…%K%P
My phone began to ring, but its tune sounded distant,\nalmost like it came from a different world altogether.%K%P
所以，那时候手机的铃声，\n对我而言也像是从异世界传来的一般…%K%P
